OL,3,GNEWSARail line shut for safety
OL,4,Ainspection after derailment
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt urged travellers to allow for an
OL,7,Fadditional 30-45 minutes for their
OL,8,Fjourneys due to the disruption, which
OL,9,Fis also impacting services to
OL,10,FEastbourne and London Victoria.
